			)
			(justify left)
		)
	)
	(gr_text "1. Geometry: r_k = 80*((k+0.5)/16).6 mm, theta_k = 9 + 137.508*k deg, k = 0..15 -> M1..M16. Port radii 10.0-78.5 mm, min spacing 27.2 mm."
		(at 2.62 415.51 0)
		(layer "User.1")
		(uuid "288ab078-2920-4241-9568-1232d0c9030e")
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.35)
				(thickness 0.1875)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
	)
	(gr_text "2. Sound enters through the D0.80 hole from the top face; the mic sits on the bottom layer with its port over the hole, sealed by the solder ring (pin 5)."
		(at 2.62 418.91 0)
		(layer "User.1")
		(uuid "a1596cab-3e8f-4d0a-970b-0aa55c6faaea")
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.35)
				(thickness 0.1875)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
	)
	(gr_text "3. Each footprint is rotated so its pads face the board centre (arrow). Rotation has no acoustic effect; only the port centre position matters."
		(at 2.62 422.31 0)
		(layer "User.1")
		(uuid "9b899b29-2745-42c6-a3f8-8b5ace042163")
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.35)
				(thickness 0.1875)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
	)
	(gr_text "4. Place the IM73A135 footprint on the BOTTOM layer in the PCB tool (it will be mirrored there); check pin 1 against the pin-1 dot of this drawing."
		(at 2.62 425.71 0)
		(layer "User.1")
		(uuid "014b042a-f053-4604-a086-aff7f79a1917")
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.35)
				(thickness 0.1875)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
	)
	(gr_text "5. Top face: no components, no silkscreen inside the D5 keep-outs, do not tent or plug the holes. Cover the holes with tape during depaneling."
		(at 2.62 429.11 0)
		(layer "User.1")
		(uuid "b7708407-9c40-49c9-acde-bdf2cf6e42bd")
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.35)
				(thickness 0.1875)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
	)
	(gr_text "6. Assembly (datasheet sec. 7): no-clean paste, no ultrasonic / air-blow cleaning, no vacuum on the port, max 3 reflow cycles."
		(at 2.62 432.51 0)
		(layer "User.1")
		(uuid "2a9e445a-c985-4be1-ba6f-94d75cfe67e6")
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.35)
				(thickness 0.1875)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
	)
	(gr_text "7. ADC groups: ADC1 M1,M4,M9,M12 | ADC2 M2,M7,M10,M15 | ADC3 M3,M6,M11,M14 | ADC4 M5,M8,M13,M16. IN1..IN4 in that order."
		(at 2.62 435.91 0)
		(layer "User.1")
		(uuid "32274c85-f942-477f-ab1b-c8289136d75e")
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.35)
				(thickness 0.1875)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
	)
	(gr_text "8. TDM: ADC1+ADC2 -> I2S port A (slots 0-3, 4-7); ADC3+ADC4 -> port B. Label 'A5' = port A slot 5. Regenerate if the netlist differs."
		(at 2.62 439.31 0)
		(layer "User.1")
		(uuid "a298a98a-1078-4b0a-b0a4-06e9fd83184a")
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.35)
				(thickness 0.1875)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
	)
	(gr_text "9. Zones are suggestions. ADC2 zone moved 4.5 mm outward vs Rev B for >= 5 mm clearance to M15."
		(at 2.62 442.71 0)
		(layer "User.1")
		(uuid "ba19f2c9-3fc3-4ee8-b764-626a3519d570")
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.35)
				(thickness 0.1875)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
	)
